<title>USA: Diamond comfortable with Q4 forecast.</title>
<headline>Diamond comfortable with Q4 forecast.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diamond Multimedia Systems Inc Chief Financial Officer Jim Walker said Thursday the company is comfortable with Wall Street estimates for its fourth quarter earnings per share of 19 to 20 cents.</p>
<p>Speaking after a presentation to the Montgomery Securities Technology Week conference, Diamond executives said business was strong in the Christmas season and the company expects to announce products from its new advanced technology group in January.</p>
<p>Last year, the maker of computer graphic electronics reported a loss of 78 cents a share.</p>
<p>-- Sam.perry@reuters.com</p>
</text>
